{"type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-repeat-stop 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，用来阻止 agent 因相同工具调用反复循环。它通过工具 guard 检查每次调用，并按 agent 分别维护连续调用记录；工具名和参数相同才会累积次数，参数对象键顺序不影响比较。达到配置阈值后，下一次相同调用会被硬拦截并提示改变参数、换工具或结束任务。插件也会在真实用户消息到来时清零该 agent 的计数，并支持启用开关、包含和排除工具名称模式。适合希望给重复失败调用设置明确停止线的 DSH Web 用户；默认允许连续六次，随后拦截，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:12-64", "lib/repeat.js:25-55"], "repo": "173787247/dsh-repeat-stop", "commit": "215addc5fbd7b907ada440a24d3bbce80574d140", "unit_id": "173787247__dsh-repeat-stop#card-1"}
{"type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-repeat-stop blocks repeated identical DSH tool calls per agent. It compares normalized arguments, stops calls past a configurable threshold, and resets after a user message. Include and exclude patterns select tracked tools. By default, the seventh identical call is blocked.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:12-64", "lib/repeat.js:25-55"], "repo": "173787247/dsh-repeat-stop", "commit": "215addc5fbd7b907ada440a24d3bbce80574d140", "unit_id": "173787247__dsh-repeat-stop#card-2"}
